  "reasoning": "The defendants forcibly seized the victim, detained him in a temple, beat him causing minor injury, and used violence and threats to obtain money, a gun, a vest and a necklace. These acts constitute illegal detention (非法拘禁罪), robbery (抢劫罪) because they used force to take property, and intentional injury (故意伤害罪) resulting in a light injury.",
